@title Schematic: EMC cable card previews its fix, Light theme, and Cancel changes nothing (1366x768)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Pick a wire of the motor cable with EMC net classes on, in the Light theme: the cable card offers "Preview: <fix>" instead of applying at once; the card says what it would do, Cancel drops it and the cable is unchanged. The pictures are the evidence.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text open emc example
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
key PageDown
wait 8
key PageDown
wait 12
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc net classes
wait 8
key Enter
wait 20
click 152 420
wait 12
expect "Cable =A1+CAB-W2"
scroll 1180 400 2000
wait 8
click_text "Preview: Use a shielded cable." #1
wait 10
expect "Preview on a copy of the project"
expect "Shield core added"
shot 01-cable-preview-light
check_layout
click_text Cancel #1
wait 10
expect_not "Preview on a copy of the project"
expect "No shield core"
shot 02-cancelled-light
check_layout
